    "更换后，iOS 会弹出一次提示。Apple Watch 上的图标不会变。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS shows a notice once when you change it. The icon on Apple Watch stays the same."
