    "暂时无法确认任务状态。退出登录可能会中断使用此账号的任务，是否继续？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Could not check running tasks. Signing out may interrupt tasks using this account. Sign out now?"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
